egend of the Ten Rings_** — returning as Trevor Slattery\n\nHe’s especially respected for how convincing he can be in very different parts: he can play noble, terrifying, witty, vulnerable, or deeply layered characters.\n\nA few things that stand out about his career:\n- He’s not just a “movie star” type; he’s often chosen for **character-driven roles**.\n- He has a strong background in **theater**, which shows in the precision of his performances.\n- He’s been willing to do both **serious awards-worthy work** and **big commercial projects**.\n- His role in **_Sexy Beast_** is often cited as one of the great villain performances of modern British cinema.\n\nSo if Marvel is your entry point, the big picture is that Kingsley is really an **Oscar-winning, classically trained, highly versatile actor** with a career that spans decades and a lot of very different kinds of acclaimed work.\n\nIf you want, I can also give you:\n1. a **best-of Ben Kingsley watchlist**, or  \n2. a **career timeline** with his most important roles.", "correctness": "pass", "graded_correctness": "substantially_complete", "graded_correctness_score": 0.75, "covered_aspects": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5], "aspect_coverage": 1.0, "answer_relevance": "pass", "claims": [{"text": "Ben Kingsley is a British-Indian actor.", "cited_source": "Ben_Kingsley.html", "grounded": true, "citation_supported": true, "attributable_to_retrieval": false}, {"text": "His career spans seven decades.", "cited_source": "Ben_Kingsley.html", "grounded": true, "citation_supported": true, "attributable_to_retrieval": false}, {"text": "He has worked in theatre, television, film, and voice roles.", "cited_source": "Ben_Kingsley.html", "grounded": true, "citation_supported": true, "attributable_to_retrieval": true}, {"text": "He began in theatre.", "cited_source": "Ben_Kingsley.html", "grounded": true, "citation_supported": true, "attributable_to_retrieval": true}, {"text": "He joined the Royal Shakespeare Company in 1967.", "cited_source": "